editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md-173-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md-174-## 7. Progression plan
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md-175-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md:176:**Vocabulary** (this series' own): fragment, notice, integration, acquisition (directed), engagement (clinical — non-hostile), Path, declaration, tier, rank, Copper/Iron/Bronze/Silver/Gold, Arbiter, sigil, idle state, deployment, the hold, discharge, the reading (surface / deep), mending, reserve, the line, quiet ground → the Quieting, perimeter, radius, stake, the board, HOLD, outcome, the wall. The system's voices are the **log** (Cael's inventory), the **notice** (one only, the tenth), and **Pike's ledger lines**. Interface text appears only where the canon calls for it.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md-177-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/BOOK_MAP.md-178-**Density targets** (≈58 per 10k overall, front-loaded about 1.7x): **first third ≈81 per 10k** (M1 ≈82, M2 ≈82, M3 ≈78); **middle third ≈48** (M4 ≈50, with the line's mechanics taught as trials; M5 ≈42, with the acquisition spike; M6 ≈40); **final third ≈46** (M7 ≈40, M8 ≈55 with the inventory and the map). After M4 the system surfaces only at genuine turns: the notice, the self-readings, the rim, the fixed point, the inventory.
